<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <title>验证 · 康予纳安</title>
  <script src="https://challenges.cloudflare.com/turnstile/v0/api.js" async defer></script>
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    body { min-height: 100vh; background: #F2F4F6; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-family: 'PingFang SC', sans-serif; }
    .card { background: #fff; border-radius: 20px; border: 0.5px solid #e0e4ea; padding: 48px 40px; text-align: center; max-width: 400px; width: 90%; }
    .title { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 500; color: #1a1a1a; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .title span { color: #4AACDB; }
    .sub { font-size: 14px; color: #888; margin-bottom: 32px; line-height: 1.7; }
    .turnstile-wrap { display: flex; justify-content: center; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .hint { font-size: 13px; color: #aaa; margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .footer-text { margin-top: 24px; font-size: 12px; color: #bbb; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <div class="title">欢迎来到<span>康予纳安</span></div>
    <div class="sub">请完成验证后进入网站 🌸</div>
    <div class="turnstile-wrap">
      <div class="cf-turnstile"
        data-sitekey="0x4AAAAAAC8Ozsq6TZw4T0Og"
        data-theme="light"
        data-callback="onVerified">
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="hint">验证成功后将自动进入网站</div>
    <div class="footer-text">© 2026 康予纳安</div>
  </div>
  <script>
    function onVerified(token) {
      localStorage.setItem('verified', 'true');
      sessionStorage.setItem('verified', 'true');
      setTimeout(function() {
        window.location.replace('/');
      }, 800);
    }
  </script>
</body>
</html>